"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ArriRawColorManagement/Description=Importer MXF and Importer ArriRaw will be color managed for ARRI RAW files"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ArriRawColorManagement/Title=ArriRaw Color Management"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/AutoLogColorSpaceInProjectSettings/Description=The control to identify Sony, Canon and Panasonic Log color spaces in files will be moved from App Prefs to Project Settings in Premiere Pro.#{comment}DVACO-4968"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/AutoLogColorSpaceInProjectSettings/Title=Automatic Log Color Space in Project Settings.#{comment}DVACO-4968"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ColorManager/Description=A new Settings tab has been added in the Lumetri Color panel to provide color settings in one place for better discoverability and ease of use. Color properties in settings dialogs like project/production settings, interpret footage and sequence settings have been consolidated into a color settings section with the dialogs for ease of use."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ColorManager/Title=Color Settings"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableParallelComputation/Description=To expedite this process, we propose a method that efficiently processes multiple frames simultaneously to detect feature points, reducing analysis time while maintaining accurate stabilization results.#{comment}DVARC-3146"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableParallelComputation/Name=Reducing Warp Stabilizer Effect Analysis time by Processing Multiple Frames for finding Feature Point#{comment}DVARC-3146"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnablePersonSelectionMask/Description=This feature enables users to automatically mask people in videos."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnablePersonSelectionMask/Title=Enable Person Selection Mask"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitNDI/EnableTransmitNDIDescription=This feature enables Transmit over NDI protocol.#{comment}DVAAT-1465"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitNDI/Title=Transmit NDI.#{comment}DVAAT-1465"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitSRT/EnableTransmitSRTDescription=Introducing our new Transmit feature, which utilizes the reliable SRT protocol to enable seamless video and audio transmission. This feature ensures that your content is delivered with the highest quality, securely and without interruptions. Thanks to the new API's added to the Transmit SDK, you can also transmit multiple audio outputs using Mercury Transmit, offering an added layer of flexibility and control.#{comment}DVAAT-1464"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitSRT/Title=Stream your video and audio with ease using SRT protocol and multiple audio support#{comment}DVAAT-1464"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitSecondaryAudio/EnableTransmitSecondaryAudioDescription=This feature enables transmitting audio via push streams to secondary devices.#{comment}DVAAT-1329"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/EnableTransmitSecondaryAudio/Title=Transmit Secondary Audio Support.#{comment}DVAAT-1329"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/InterpretFootage/LUTEmbed/Description=Embeds Modify Clip > Color > Input LUTs in the project file."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/InterpretFootage/LUTEmbed/Title=Input LUT Embed"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriColor/LUTIndex/Description=Resolves issues with Lumetri LUTs menu indexing."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriColor/LUTIndex/Title=Lumetri LUT Indexing"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriColor/LUTManagement/Description=Upgrade LUT and Looks Management for Lumetri Creative and Basic Correction Workflows. This feature modernises the LUT menus and solves several issues related to LUT identification using menu indices."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriColor/LUTManagement/Title=Lumetri LUT Management"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriEffectColorSpaceAware/Description=This feature makes Lumetri effect color space aware. Currently all conversion in Lumetri effect assumes color space as Rec. 709 and doesn't honor HDR color spaces properly.#{comment}DVACO-5613"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/LumetriEffectColorSpaceAware/Title=Lumetri Effect Color Space Aware.#{comment}DVACO-5613"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/MatchSourceColorSpace/Description=Enable colorspace support in matchsource functionality while export."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/MatchSourceColorSpace/Title=Match Source ColorSpace on Export"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/NewColorExperience/Description=A new workflow for color grading in Premiere Pro."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/NewColorExperience/Name=New Color Experience#{comment}DVACO-5680"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ProjectToTeamInplaceConvertAndCloseFeatureID/Description=This Beta-feature enables in place migration of a local Project to a Team Project. During migrating process the local Project will be replaced in memory with a new Team Project that saves time and memory used. The source Project won't be changed or affected in any way and can be loaded again in its original state."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/ProjectToTeamInplaceConvertAndCloseFeatureID/Title=In place Project to Team Project migration"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/UserSelectableSDRGamma/Description=The control to allow users to select the Gamma to be use for SDR media. This feature will help user to choose Rec.709-A Gamma to match application exports with QT Player"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/UserSelectableSDRGamma/Title=User Selectable Viewer Gamma.#{comment}DVACO-2430"
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/WideColorGamutTimeline/Description=This feature enable support for Wide color gamut timeline. It adds a wide color gamut color space as another option under sequence color space."
"$$$/MediaCore/BetaFeature/WideColorGamutTimeline/Title=Wide Color Gamut Timeline.#{comment}DVACO-5612"
