"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/Level_Desc=Constrains encoding parameters such as bit rate range and maximum frame size."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_AutoGOPPlacement_Desc=Specifies if the encoder would automatically start a new GOP whenever there is a scene change."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_BufferSize_Desc=Minimum VBV buffer size required to decode sequence without overflows or underflows, or 0 to use the default system-computed value."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_ClosedGOP_Desc=Specifies the distance of closed GOPs. A closed GOP can be decoded by itself and does not reference any previous GOP. Set to 1 to close every GOP."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_ColorPrimaries_Desc=x, y chromaticity coordinates of the source primaries. Does not affect encoding."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_DCPrec_Desc=Specifies the precision of the DC coefficients in intra-coded macroblocks. Higher values improve quality at high data rates, but hurt quality at lower data rates."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_EmbedSVCDUsrBlk_Desc=Specifies whether to embed SVCD user data blocks in the video stream or not."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_IgnoreFrameInterv_Desc=Specifies interval for number of frames to be ignored. Use 0 to not ignore any frames."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_MQuantValue_Desc=Macroblock Quantization value."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_M_Desc=The distance between consecutive I and P frames."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_Matrix_Coefficients_Desc=Matrix Coefficients is used in deriving luminance and chrominance signals from R,G,B."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_MinFramePercent_Desc=Zero padding occurs if actual frame size is less than target frame size percentage."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_N_Desc=The distance between consecutive I frames, a multiple of M frames."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_NoiseControl_Desc=Sensitivity reduces noise above a certain threshold. Reduction affects all sources."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_PadFramePercent_Desc=Specifies what percentage of the target frame size to zero fill to."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_ProgSeq_Desc=Program sequence specifies whether video frames are interlaced with fields or are full-frame progressive."
"$$$/MediaCore/Exporters/ExporterMPEG2/VideoGroup/MCVideo_SDEFormat_Desc=The representation of the pictures before being encoded. Does not affect encoding."
