"$$$/Mediacore/DisplaySurface/BetaFeature/EnableDirectXHDR/Desc2=Windows native HDR is now supported with DirectX 12 display, it allows viewing HDR content directly inside App under Windows HDR mode. You may toggle in-app Display Color Management option to enable and disable DirectX HDR. To enable Windows native HDR mode, go to system display settings and switch on \"Play HDR games and apps\". A DirectX 12 compatible GPU and an HDR capable display are required for enabling system HDR mode."
