"$$$/TeamProjects/LoadTeamProjectsProgressivelyFeatureDescription=Faster Team Projects loading in Premiere Pro. Team Project loading is optimized to get you editing as soon as possible. Assets are now loaded in a prioritized queue at the bin level. As an editor opens a bin, the bin&apos;s assets will be moved to the front of the queue to be loaded. This process results in the most important items being loaded first for the editing session. Editing can begin nearly immediately (no need to wait for all assets to load)."
"$$$/TeamProjects/LoadTeamProjectsProgressivelyFeatureName=Team Projects: Progressive Project Loading in Premiere Pro"
"$$$/TeamProjects/OnDemandTeamProjectsLoadFeatureDescription=On demand Team Projects load in Premiere Pro. Further improving of Progressive Team Project loading by not loading any assets unless they are used/demanded)."
"$$$/TeamProjects/OnDemandTeamProjectsLoadFeatureName=Team Projects: On demand Team Projects load in Premiere Pro"
"$$$/TeamProjects/PrioritizedSequenceLoadFeatureDescription=Prioritized Sequences loading in Premiere Pro. Further improving of Progressive Team Project loading to have sequences available as soon as possible)."
"$$$/TeamProjects/PrioritizedSequenceLoadFeatureName=Team Projects: Prioritized Sequences Loading in Premiere Pro"
